{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110914","id":2862159696,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6qmRdQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110914","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110914.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110914.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110914","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110914/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110914/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110914/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0590c974c19ef59bb019d70b8b2f511f2356e5f1","number":110914,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix CCD bodies adding multiple contact manifolds when using Jolt","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #110757.\r\n\r\nThe code in `JoltContactListener3D::_try_add_contacts`, as called by Jolt through its `JPH::ContactListener` callback interface, does not currently take into account that CCD collisions can cause it to be called multiple times in a single physics step for the same shape pair. This means that a `RigidBody3D` with `continuous_cd` enabled, as well as a non-zero `max_contacts_reported`, can end up with a list of contacts that actually make up two different contact manifolds, which is bad.\r\n\r\nIn 4.5-stable this also resulted in an error about `reserve() called with a capacity smaller than the current size`, but which has since been relegated to a `--verbose` warning as of #110826.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes all that by simply doing an early-out from `JoltContactListener3D::_try_add_contacts` if the shape pair in question already has a set of contacts.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"cl